1
00:00:00,458 --> 00:00:02,002
That last throw was almost ninety yards,

2
00:00:02,002 --> 00:00:02,919
and he nailed it.

3
00:00:03,128 --> 00:00:04,254
Come on, 
nobody's that good.

4
00:00:04,254 --> 00:00:05,046
Who the hell is this guy?

5
00:00:06,214 --> 00:00:08,049
Guys, I got a whole book of plays, okay?

6
00:00:08,508 --> 00:00:09,634
And look, I know a bunch of you guys

7
00:00:09,634 --> 00:00:11,344
don't trust me, but I promise you,

8
00:00:12,137 --> 00:00:14,347
if you follow my plays,
we will win this game.

9
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:18,351
I mean, we're already getting our asses kicked.

10
00:00:18,351 --> 00:00:19,269
Might as well try it.

11
00:00:19,561 --> 00:00:20,520
No way we're 
coming back.

12
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:21,855
Look, if we lose...

13
00:00:22,397 --> 00:00:24,649
it'll show you're not fit
to be our coach.

14
00:00:30,739 --> 00:00:31,698
Touchdown.

15
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,284
That fast?

16
00:00:34,743 --> 00:00:35,326
Wait,

17
00:00:35,326 --> 00:00:36,995
is this playbook 
actually working?

18
00:00:43,501 --> 00:00:44,377
Man, I hope I'm 
not going to be

19
00:00:44,377 --> 00:00:45,503
benched all the time.

20
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:48,548
And that's the game!

21
00:00:48,548 --> 00:00:50,091
Knights take the win!

22
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:51,384
Let's go!

23
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,803
A win like this.

24
00:00:53,845 --> 00:00:55,597
We never even
dreamed of!

25
00:00:56,014 --> 00:00:58,099
Following his plays,
we actually crushed it!

26
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,601
Who is this guy anyway?

27
00:01:17,911 --> 00:01:18,995
Welcome to
the team, coach!

28
00:01:24,793 --> 00:01:25,835
Go, Knights!
